# VIZUÁLIS ELEMZÉS - REPLIT IDE FELÜLET

A feltöltött HTML a Replit IDE teljes felületét tartalmazza. Az alábbi vizuális struktúrát azonosítottam:

## Színpaletta és Komponensek
- **Háttérszínek**: Sötét téma (#0E1525, #1C2333, #2B3245)
- **Akcentszínek**: Narancssárga (#F97316), Kék (#3B82F6), Zöld (#10B981)
- **Szövegszínek**: Fehér (#FFFFFF), Szürke árnyalatok (#9CA3AF, #6B7280)
- **Fő komponensek**: 
  - Bal oldali fájlkezelő sidebar (collapsible)
  - Központi kódszerkesztő panel
  - Jobb oldali többfunkciós panel (Console/Preview/Agent/Tools)
  - Felső navigációs sáv
  - Alsó státuszsáv

***

# PIXELPONTOS REPLIT KLÓN - TELJES IMPLEMENTÁCIÓ

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hu" class="dark">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Replit Clone - Professional IDE</title>
    <script src=""></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="">
    <style>
        @import url('');

        :root {
            --bg-primary: #0E1525;
            --bg-secondary: #1C2333;
            --bg-tertiary: #2B3245;
            --bg-hover: #374151;
            --border-color: #374151;
            --text-primary: #FFFFFF;
            --text-secondary: #9CA3AF;
            --text-tertiary: #6B7280;
            --accent-orange: #F97316;
            --accent-blue: #3B82F6;
            --accent-green: #10B981;
            --accent-red: #EF4444;
            --accent-yellow: #F59E0B;
            --accent-purple: #8B5CF6;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg-primary);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .monaco-editor {
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', 'Fira Code', 'Courier New', monospace;
        }

        /* Scrollbar Styling */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 10px;
            height: 10px;
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: var(--bg-tertiary);
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
            background: var(--bg-hover);
        }

        /* Split Pane Resizer */
        .resizer {
            background: var(--border-color);
            cursor: col-resize;
            width: 4px;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        .resizer:hover {
            background: var(--accent-blue);
        }

        .resizer-horizontal {
            cursor: row-resize;
            height: 4px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        /* File Tree Styling */
        .file-tree-item {
            padding: 6px 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 6px;
            transition: all 0.15s;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            font-size: 13px;
            user-select: none;
        }

        .file-tree-item:hover {
            background: var(--bg-hover);
        }

        .file-tree-item.active {
            background: var(--bg-tertiary);
            color: var(--accent-orange);
        }

        .file-tree-item.nested {
            padding-left: 28px;
        }

        .file-tree-item.nested-2 {
            padding-left: 44px;
        }

        /* Tab Styling */
        .tab {
            padding: 8px 16px;
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border-right: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            font-size: 13px;
            transition: all 0.15s;
            position: relative;
        }

        .tab:hover {
            background: var(--bg-tertiary);
        }

        .tab.active {
            background: var(--bg-primary);
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent-orange);
        }

        .tab .close-btn {
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.15s;
        }

        .tab:hover .close-btn {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        /* Button Styling */
        .btn {
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.15s;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--accent-orange);
            color: white;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #EA580C;
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: var(--bg-tertiary);
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: var(--bg-hover);
        }

        .btn-ghost {
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }

        .btn-ghost:hover {
            background: var(--bg-tertiary);
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        /* Input Styling */
        .input {
            background: var(--bg-tertiary);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-size: 14px;
            outline: none;
            transition: all 0.15s;
        }

        .input:focus {
            border-color: var(--accent-blue);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
        }

        /* Code Editor Styling */
        .code-editor {
            background: var(--bg-primary);
            padding: 16px;
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow: auto;
            height: 100%;
        }

        .line-numbers {
            color: var(--text-tertiary);
            user-select: none;
            padding-right: 16px;
            text-align: right;
            min-width: 40px;
        }

        /* Syntax Highlighting */
        .keyword { color: #FF79C6; }
        .string { color: #50FA7B; }
        .comment { color: #6272A4; font-style: italic; }
        .function { color: #8BE9FD; }
        .number { color: #BD93F9; }
        .operator { color: #FF79C6; }
        .class-name { color: #F1FA8C; }

        /* Console Styling */
        .console-output {
            background: var(--bg-primary);
            padding: 12px;
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            overflow-y: auto;
            height: 100%;
        }

        .console-line {
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .console-error {
            color: var(--accent-red);
        }

        .console-warning {
            color: var(--accent-yellow);
        }

        .console-success {
            color: var(--accent-green);
        }

        .console-info {
            color: var(--accent-blue);
        }

        /* Terminal Styling */
        .terminal {
            background: #000000;
            padding: 12px;
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }

        .terminal-prompt {
            color: var(--accent-green);
        }

        .terminal-cursor {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 8px;
            height: 16px;
            background: var(--text-primary);
            animation: blink 1s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes blink {
            0%, 49% { opacity: 1; }
            50%, 100% { opacity: 0; }
        }

        /* Dropdown Styling */
        .dropdown {
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .dropdown-content {
            display: none;
            position: absolute;
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            min-width: 200px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 6px;
            z-index: 1000;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .dropdown:hover .dropdown-content {
            display: block;
        }

        .dropdown-item {
            padding: 8px 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 14px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .dropdown-item:hover {
            background: var(--bg-tertiary);
        }

        /* Tooltip */
        .tooltip {
            position: relative;
        }

        .tooltip .tooltiptext {
            visibility: hidden;
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 6px 10px;
            position: absolute;
            z-index: 1;
            bottom: 125%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.2s;
            font-size: 12px;
            white-space: nowrap;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .tooltip:hover .tooltiptext {
            visibility: visible;
            opacity: 1;
        }

        /* Badge */
        .badge {
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .badge-orange {
            background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.2);
            color: var(--accent-orange);
        }

        .badge-blue {
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
            color: var(--accent-blue);
        }

        .badge-green {
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
            color: var(--accent-green);
        }

        /* Modal */
        .modal {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            z-index: 2000;
            left: 0;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .modal.active {
            display: flex;
        }

        .modal-content {
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 90%;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        /* Loading Spinner */
        .spinner {
            border: 3px solid var(--bg-tertiary);
            border-top: 3px solid var(--accent-orange);
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 24px;
            height: 24px;
            animation: spin 0.8s linear infinite;
        }

        @keyframes spin {
            0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        /* Context Menu */
        .context-menu {
            position: fixed;
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 6px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            z-index: 9999;
            display: none;
        }

        .context-menu.active {
            display: block;
        }

        /* Notification */
        .notification {
            position: fixed;
            top: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            z-index: 3000;
            min-width: 300px;
            animation: slideIn 0.3s ease-out;
        }

        @keyframes slideIn {
            from {
                transform: translateX(400px);
                opacity: 0;
            }
            to {
                transform: translateX(0);
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }

        /* Split View Container */
        .split-view {
            display: flex;
            height: 100%;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .split-pane {
            overflow: auto;
        }

        /* File Icons */
        .file-icon {
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .file-icon-python::before {
            content: '🐍';
        }

        .file-icon-javascript::before {
            content: '📜';
        }

        .file-icon-html::before {
            content: '🌐';
        }

        .file-icon-css::before {
            content: '🎨';
        }

        .file-icon-json::before {
            content: '📋';
        }

        .file-icon-folder::before {
            content: '📁';
        }

        .file-icon-folder.open::before {
            content: '📂';
        }

        /* Status Indicators */
        .status-dot {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-right: 6px;
        }

        .status-running {
            background: var(--accent-green);
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }

        .status-stopped {
            background: var(--accent-red);
        }

        .status-building {
            background: var(--accent-yellow);
            animation: pulse 1s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0.4; }
        }

        /* Sidebar Panel Headers */
        .panel-header {
            padding: 12px 16px;
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 13px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }

        /* Editor Gutter */
        .editor-gutter {
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            padding: 16px 12px;
            min-width: 50px;
            user-select: none;
        }

        /* Breadcrumb Navigation */
        .breadcrumb {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            padding: 8px 16px;
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .breadcrumb-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        .breadcrumb-separator {
            color: var(--text-tertiary);
        }

        /* Search Box */
        .search-box {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .search-box input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 8px 12px 8px 36px;
        }

        .search-box .search-icon {
            position: absolute;
            left: 12px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            color: var(--text-tertiary);
        }

        /* Command Palette */
        .command-palette {
            position: fixed;
            top: 20%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border-radius: 12px;
            width: 600px;
            max-height: 400px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            overflow: hidden;
            z-index: 4000;
        }

        .command-palette-input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            background: var(--bg-tertiary);
            border: none;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-size: 16px;
            outline: none;
        }

        .command-palette-results {
            max-height: 340px;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }

        .command-palette-item {
            padding: 12px 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .command-palette-item:hover,
        .command-palette-item.selected {
            background: var(--bg-tertiary);
        }

        /* Minimap */
        .minimap {
            width: 120px;
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border-left: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .minimap-viewport {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-blue);
        }

        /* Git Integration */
        .git-status {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .git-branch {
            color: var(--accent-purple);
        }

        .git-changes {
            color: var(--accent-yellow);
        }

        /* Collaborator Avatars */
        .collaborator-avatar {
            width: 24px;
            height: 24px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 2px solid var(--bg-primary);
            display: inline-block;
            margin-left: -8px;
        }

        .collaborator-avatar:first-child {
            margin-left: 0;
        }

        /* Package Manager Panel */
        .package-item {
            padding: 12px;
            background: var(--bg-tertiary);
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        /* AI Assistant Chat */
        .chat-message {
            padding: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            max-width: 80%;
        }

        .chat-message.user {
            background: var(--bg-tertiary);
            margin-left: auto;
        }

        .chat-message.assistant {
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-blue);
        }

        /* Responsive Design */
        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .sidebar {
                width: 200px !important;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .sidebar {
                position: absolute;
                left: -250px;
                z-index: 100;
                transition: left 0.3s;
            }

            .sidebar.mobile-open {
                left: 0;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
